                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>304.26855</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>304.26855</X>
                      <Y>135.54541</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cd" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>45</X>
                      <Y>135.54541</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">adf670a7-7afb-46b8-96aa-328b37ba193a</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 1  -  One value per floor
Goal: a list from 0 (base) to 1 (top), one value per floor, and
   its mirror from 1 down to 0.
Idea: Range splits a domain into equal steps. Every node after
   it now works on the whole list: all floors at once.
Watch for: The second Range has its domain set to 1 to 0. That
   makes the mirror list (1 - t) with no extra maths.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>40</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>269.26855</W>
                          <H>80.54541</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>45</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="40">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
                    <item name="Bold" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Ca" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>413</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>666.3623</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>666.3623</X>
                      <Y>135.54102</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cd" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>413</X>
                      <Y>135.54102</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">055907d4-7972-49e0-b462-79b8af2c0bb1</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 2  -  Floor levels
Goal: a centre point at the height of every floor.
Idea: Total height = Floors × Floor-to-floor. Each floor's
   height = t × total. Construct Point turns those heights into
   points.
Watch for: This replaces B01's Unit Z + Move: every floor gets
   its own height in one go.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>408</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>263.3623</W>
                          <H>80.541016</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>413</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="41">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
                    <item name="Bold" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Ca" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1067</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1307.6973</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1307.6973</X>
                      <Y>135.43555</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cd" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1067</X>
                      <Y>135.43555</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">88bc835a-2e8b-4233-9c36-67b76487745b</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 3  -  Taper the size
Goal: a radius and a fillet for every floor, blending from the
   base values to the top values.
Idea: Blend = base × (1 - t) + top × t. At the base t = 0, so
   you get the base radius; at the top t = 1, the top radius.
Watch for: Multiply first, then add: the two shares add up to
   one value per floor.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>1062</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>250.69727</W>
                          <H>80.43555</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>1067</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="42">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
                    <item name="Bold" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Ca" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1592</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1834.2222</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1834.2222</X>
                      <Y>125.191895</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cd" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1592</X>
                      <Y>125.191895</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">94e724f5-1e73-4d10-b779-18e96c26fbc5</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 4  -  Floor outlines
Goal: one outline per floor, at its own height and size.
Idea: Polygon accepts lists: a list of centre points and a list
   of radii draws one outline per item.
Watch for: One point, one radius and one fillet per floor: the
   lists line up item by item.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>1587</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>252.22217</W>
                          <H>70.191895</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>1592</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="43">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
                    <item name="Bold" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Ca" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1959</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>2212.4897</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>2212.4897</X>
                      <Y>145.89014</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cd" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1959</X>
                      <Y>145.89014</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">da08e510-a721-4cb5-89b3-2a40c8221cf7</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 5  -  Twist each floor
Goal: each outline turned a little more than the one below.
Idea: Angle per floor = t × Total twist: the base turns 0° and
   the roof the full twist. Rotate pairs each outline with its
   own angle and centre.
Watch for: Degrees is switched on for the A input; without it 90
   would mean 90 radians.
Wire check: angle list -&gt; A, centre points -&gt; P.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>1954</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>263.48975</W>
                          <H>90.89014</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>1959</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="44">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
                    <item name="Bold" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Ca" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>2508</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>2775.148</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>2775.148</X>
                      <Y>125.191895</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cd" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>2508</X>
                      <Y>125.191895</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">78008029-ef81-4031-9d58-87dd7e40b5e6</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 6  -  Skin the floors
Goal: one surface through every floor outline.
Idea: With many section curves, Loft makes one smooth skin that
   follows every floor's size and twist.
Watch for: The outlines must arrive in floor order, base to
   roof: Range already guarantees that.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>2503</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>277.14795</W>
                          <H>70.191895</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>2508</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="45">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
                    <item name="Bold" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Ca" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>2855.148</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>3112.0303</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
