                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">12</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LEVEL B - Build the twisting mass  |  B02 (Intermediate method)  |  Twisty tower series - WALKTHROUGH.  Units: feet.
One concept per stage. Every stage opens with a note:  Goal (what it makes)  -  Idea (the concept)  -  Watch for (common mistakes)  -  Wire check (which input a wire goes into).
GIVEN = built in an earlier level, pre-placed, not quizzed.  RECAP = a node you already know, not quizzed.  STEP n = quizzed: red B02_Q## is the question node.
Green _Correct = locked copy.  Blue _Choices = 12 locked wrong choices.  Built only from components the PathOGen solver supports.
Questions: B02_Q01 Range   B02_Q02 Multiplication   B02_Q03 Addition   B02_Q04 Polygon   B02_Q05 Rotate   B02_Q06 Loft   B02_Q07 Cap Holes   B02_Q08 Area</item>
